# Image Captioning using Deep Learning

This project generates captions for images using CNN + LSTM.

## Technologies Used
- Python
- TensorFlow / PyTorch
- NLP
- CNN (ResNet/VGG)
- LSTM

## How to Run
1. Install requirements
   pip install -r requirements.txt
2. Run the model
   python app.py

## Output
Generates a caption for the given image.
